  "reasoning": "The defendant operated two hot‑pot restaurants and knowingly sold large quantities of lamb meat that had passed its shelf‑life, amounting to hundreds of thousands of yuan. This constitutes the manufacturing and sale of food that does not meet safety standards, which corresponds to the statutory offense “生产、销售不符合安全标准的食品”. No other distinct criminal conduct is described in the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]生产、销售不符合安全标准的食品<eoa>"
